{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"text\": \"从前他怕一往前做就会把刚找回的温柔磨掉，便想退回安宁里护住那种生活。\",\n      \"key\": \"磨掉温柔\",\n      \"follows\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他带着对那种生活的牵挂继续往前做，发现眼前的事也在替它争取，旧愿反而近了些。\",\n      \"key\": \"旧愿近了\",\n      \"follows\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再嫌自己肩上有事还惦记那种生活，发现这份惦记和眼前该做的事都推着他向前，心里很高兴。\",\n      \"key\": \"惦记那种生活\",\n      \"follows\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他记得自己当初确实因相信那种生活而快乐过，所以眼下还没过上，也不愿否认那段经历。\",\n      \"key\": \"当初相信\",\n      \"follows\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他试过光靠坚持往前，仍没法让自己安心，所以不再把加力当成唯一办法。\",\n      \"key\": \"再使劲\",\n      \"follows\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"text\": \"他愿意为那种生活吃苦，也会想想再使劲会不会把刚找回的温柔搭进去。\",\n      \"key\": \"愿意吃苦\",\n      \"follows\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"text\": \"真到了要承受代价的时候，他还是可能累得想退回安宁。\",\n      \"key\": \"退回安宁\",\n      \"follows\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-8\",\n      \"text\": \"他松了口气，不再反复找理由证明自己该往前，仍清楚知道那种生活是自己想要的。\",\n      \"key\": \"清楚知道\",\n      \"follows\": true\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"失效\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-8\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-8\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"去掉重新尝到快乐的描写，保留他记得那段快乐确实发生过的个人认识，说明为什么眼下尚未实现也不愿否认那份向往。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"原句只有愿望未必实现的判断，缺少个人原因。改用前文光靠坚持仍不能让他安心的经历，说明他为何不再把加力当成唯一办法。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "10137eb5-7267-400c-9f37-92adabebd40b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T023341038461Z", "elapsed_seconds": 64.078, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T02:34:45.463297+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "64e8da323cf4ad85463098b90e59cab0903a70591a10d29c6bc2a0fac1eed6a4", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T023341038461Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "dfa4fd8780b45547b553fca010110642ebd5a17a4bcc98fab5d5e8ff5491dc40"}}}
